@startuml
' Layered view of a running container image:
' Application -> Runtime -> Operating System, each layer bundling
' its own extra content (library dependencies / OS packages).
' Mirrors what images.conf / measure-images.sh compare across strategies.

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #33393f
    FontColor #1c1f22
}
rectangle "Application" as App #A9CCE3
rectangle "Dependencies\n(libraries, .jars, native libs)" as Deps #D4E6F1

rectangle "Runtime" as Runtime #A9DFBF
note right of Runtime
  e.g. JVM (Temurin, Zulu),
  GraalVM native-image,
  or none (static/native binary)
end note

rectangle "Operating System" as OS #F5CBA7
rectangle "OS Packages" as Pkgs #FAE5D3

App -down-> Runtime : runs on
Runtime -down-> OS : runs on

App -right-> Deps : bundles
OS -right-> Pkgs : has installed

@enduml
